WEBVTT

01:36.720 --> 01:41.070
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.360 --> 01:43.900
[Episode 19]

01:48.759 --> 01:50.490
Fate seems to be laughing at me.

01:53.229 --> 01:55.890
Everything was arranged
in the original story,

01:56.710 --> 01:58.310
and the ending was destined.

01:59.840 --> 02:02.000
Now I realize that the more I struggle,

02:03.640 --> 02:05.070
the more mistakes I make.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.430
I even

02:09.560 --> 02:11.400
make the ending worse.

02:14.750 --> 02:16.280
They all died because of me—

02:18.120 --> 02:20.910
it was my fault
that dragged them down with me.

02:21.960 --> 02:24.520
Father, Mother.

02:27.360 --> 02:29.079
I've truly failed you.

02:31.000 --> 02:33.520
I should never have come into this world.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.750
I've let you down.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.630
I've failed you.

02:41.520 --> 02:42.870
I'm so sorry.

02:57.040 --> 02:58.810
[In Memory of Late Father, Xiao Xilou]

02:58.840 --> 03:00.700
[In Memory of Late Mother, Sun Huishan]

03:01.910 --> 03:02.590
Qiushui.

03:04.310 --> 03:05.570
Who says you're wrong?

03:11.280 --> 03:12.740
Throughout this journey,

03:13.030 --> 03:14.830
no matter who it might have been,

03:15.630 --> 03:17.760
no one could have done better than you.

03:18.910 --> 03:19.510
Tang Fang.

03:21.470 --> 03:23.200
You don't need to say anything.

03:25.240 --> 03:28.280
I know that no matter
what I say right now,

03:29.240 --> 03:31.370
it won't be able to ease your feelings.

03:32.870 --> 03:36.329
All renowned doctors
have some connection with the Tang Sect.

03:36.680 --> 03:38.680
I will definitely find a way

03:39.190 --> 03:40.000
to cure you.

03:45.190 --> 03:46.240
I'll be okay.

03:47.680 --> 03:48.470
Thank you.

03:49.710 --> 03:50.910
You should leave too.

03:52.680 --> 03:53.880
Don't waste your time

03:54.520 --> 03:56.280
on a useless person like me.

04:02.120 --> 04:03.850
You challenged the Power Gang,

04:05.310 --> 04:06.710
faced death without fear

04:07.310 --> 04:08.710
to expose the Sword King,

04:09.910 --> 04:13.110
and risked being shattered to pieces
to save your family.

04:15.640 --> 04:17.230
Such a Xiao Qiushui

04:18.260 --> 04:20.019
is the pride of us all.

04:22.600 --> 04:23.680
What is real,

04:25.360 --> 04:26.430
and what is fake?

04:28.720 --> 04:29.630
In this world,

04:31.750 --> 04:33.240
who could truly know?

04:43.920 --> 04:45.120
I won't say much more.

04:46.159 --> 04:47.120
Another day, I'll...

04:47.120 --> 04:48.320
There is no other day.

04:51.830 --> 04:52.590
Tang Fang.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.750
Everything is over.

04:56.670 --> 04:57.470
You should go.

04:59.680 --> 05:01.680
There's nothing worth staying for.

05:06.320 --> 05:07.200
Take care.

05:13.060 --> 05:17.450
[Xiao's Villa in Jinzhong]

05:14.000 --> 05:14.680
No problem.

05:15.390 --> 05:15.780
Okay.

05:17.340 --> 05:17.870
Alright.

05:17.910 --> 05:18.910
You all can go now.

05:22.710 --> 05:25.990
[Huanhua Sect]

05:28.360 --> 05:30.140
[Xiao Xilou]

05:34.720 --> 05:35.390
Yiren.

05:39.270 --> 05:41.120
All the supplies needed to reestablish

05:41.120 --> 05:42.380
our sect are ready now.

05:43.520 --> 05:44.120
By the way,

05:45.680 --> 05:48.430
when will the swords commissioned from

05:49.720 --> 05:51.040
the Sword Forging Manor be completed?

05:51.040 --> 05:52.100
Within three days.

05:53.040 --> 05:53.720
Yiren,

05:54.430 --> 05:56.030
our family is in trouble now.

05:56.190 --> 05:58.250
You are the pillar of our Xiao family.

05:58.310 --> 05:59.680
We all depend on you.

06:00.070 --> 06:00.720
So, Yiren,

06:01.920 --> 06:04.270
please don't dwell in sorrow anymore.

06:04.840 --> 06:05.520
I know.

06:08.390 --> 06:10.990
The reason I started
recruiting new disciples

06:11.630 --> 06:13.270
just seven days after our parents' passing

06:13.270 --> 06:14.600
to reestablish our sect

06:14.680 --> 06:17.510
is to revive our Xiao family at all costs.

06:17.950 --> 06:19.870
Our Huanhua Sect is named after the sword.

06:19.870 --> 06:20.800
Without swords,

06:21.310 --> 06:23.170
we cannot recruit new disciples.

06:23.630 --> 06:27.160
Therefore, regarding the swords
from the Sword Forging Manor,

06:27.800 --> 06:29.600
I'll need you to escort them personally.

06:29.600 --> 06:30.190
Yes.

06:31.510 --> 06:33.240
There's just one small matter.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.000
What is it?

06:35.510 --> 06:37.440
Common weapons are easy to obtain,

06:37.870 --> 06:39.390
but did Father ever tell you

06:39.390 --> 06:40.920
where the Changge Sword is?

06:43.830 --> 06:44.390
Yiren,

06:44.720 --> 06:46.780
though many in the martial world know

06:47.040 --> 06:49.870
Father would eventually pass the position
of Master to you,

06:49.870 --> 06:51.830
without the Changge Sword
that represents leadership

06:51.830 --> 06:52.960
in your possession,

06:53.270 --> 06:55.400
there will inevitably be some gossip.

06:55.780 --> 06:57.510
As the eldest son of the Xiao family,

06:57.510 --> 06:59.440
now that I am restoring our family,

06:59.760 --> 07:01.790
how could I be afraid of a few rumors?

07:02.600 --> 07:04.000
It's not just about that.

07:04.870 --> 07:07.000
The reason we've summoned these sects

07:07.270 --> 07:08.560
is to reclaim the lands

07:09.430 --> 07:11.830
that Huanhua Sect lent them before, right?

07:12.040 --> 07:14.040
Back then, they didn't lift a finger

07:14.270 --> 07:15.950
when our Xiao family was in trouble.

07:15.950 --> 07:16.680
What if today

07:17.750 --> 07:19.430
they deny it as well?

07:22.190 --> 07:22.920
Don't worry.

07:23.750 --> 07:25.010
If they don't admit it,

07:25.560 --> 07:27.490
I have my own way of dealing with it.

07:31.270 --> 07:32.190
Reestablishing the Huanhua Sect

07:32.190 --> 07:34.720
is the only way
to honor our parents' spirits.

07:38.280 --> 07:40.780
[Wave-Listening Pavilion]

08:09.720 --> 08:10.360
Master!

08:12.430 --> 08:13.000
Master!

08:13.240 --> 08:13.870
Master.

08:14.750 --> 08:18.150
I've obtained the Life-Restoring Pill
from the Herbal King.

08:31.430 --> 08:33.090
During your return this time,

08:33.480 --> 08:34.840
did you hear any rumors?

08:35.510 --> 08:38.320
Chief didn't mention anything
about the Hero Command Token,

08:38.320 --> 08:38.960
but...

08:40.120 --> 08:40.750
Go on.

08:43.549 --> 08:45.270
When Qu Hanshan reported to Chief,

08:45.270 --> 08:46.670
he put all the blame on you

08:46.700 --> 08:48.630
for failing to obtain
the Hero Command Token.

08:48.630 --> 08:49.510
Chief has ordered

08:49.510 --> 08:51.030
the Fire King to investigate thoroughly.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.830
It's my fault for failing Chief.

08:53.470 --> 08:54.670
I can't blame others.

09:20.880 --> 09:23.190
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

09:23.210 --> 09:27.920
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

09:28.180 --> 09:30.530
♪ The wind blows ♪

09:30.560 --> 09:35.000
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

09:35.600 --> 09:38.050
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

09:37.200 --> 09:39.320
For all Huanhua Sect disciples
who died in battle,

09:38.070 --> 09:40.540
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

09:40.030 --> 09:42.390
their memorial tablets
must be carved with broken swords,

09:40.560 --> 09:43.670
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

09:43.030 --> 09:45.150
and the swords should be placed
in their tombs.

09:44.360 --> 09:51.640
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

09:55.670 --> 09:58.770
♪ Unspoken regret, shattered in the sand ♪

09:58.900 --> 10:02.120
♪ Yesterday was a dream
difficult to find ♪

10:03.070 --> 10:06.350
♪ So far away in the blink of an eye ♪

10:06.420 --> 10:09.410
♪ With weeds overgrown, where is home? ♪

10:10.580 --> 10:13.780
♪ Owing love and hate;
favors and feuds rain down ♪

10:13.800 --> 10:17.530
♪ Too many apologies to be said ♪

10:17.980 --> 10:20.870
♪ Missed in the intersection of time ♪

10:21.690 --> 10:23.930
♪ The inevitable destiny ♪

10:24.440 --> 10:26.420
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

10:26.450 --> 10:30.510
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

10:32.170 --> 10:34.840
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

10:34.860 --> 10:38.320
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

10:38.920 --> 10:41.470
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

10:41.500 --> 10:45.750
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

10:46.220 --> 10:48.670
♪ The wind blows ♪

10:48.690 --> 10:53.610
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

10:53.730 --> 10:55.960
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

10:56.140 --> 10:58.760
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

10:58.780 --> 11:02.000
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

11:02.460 --> 11:08.800
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

11:08.960 --> 11:11.200
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

11:11.370 --> 11:13.990
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

11:14.010 --> 11:17.230
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

11:17.460 --> 11:23.800
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

11:27.420 --> 11:29.660
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

11:29.680 --> 11:32.230
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

11:32.250 --> 11:35.470
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

11:36.090 --> 11:42.440
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

11:43.360 --> 11:51.370
♪ As the flowers fall,
my heart falls with them ♪

11:49.120 --> 11:51.510
Big Brother has been carving
memorial tablets

11:51.510 --> 11:53.170
for three days without sleep.

12:15.510 --> 12:16.320
Big Brother.

12:16.750 --> 12:18.720
Yiren is holding a banquet in the villa.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.670
He's invited all the sects in Jindu,

12:20.670 --> 12:23.400
saying he wants to reestablish
the Huanhua Sect.

12:29.990 --> 12:31.960
[Xiao Residence]

12:39.750 --> 12:41.510
Thank you all for coming from afar.

12:41.510 --> 12:43.570
I, Xiao Yiren, pay my respects to you.

12:47.750 --> 12:49.630
The Huanhua Sect has extended
such a warm invitation.

12:49.630 --> 12:51.150
How could we possibly decline?

12:51.150 --> 12:54.000
Mr. Xiao, you've arranged
such a grand gathering for us,

12:54.000 --> 12:55.510
so there must be important matters
to discuss.

12:55.510 --> 12:56.390
To be honest,

12:56.600 --> 12:58.800
our Xiao family is in trouble right now.

12:58.960 --> 13:01.820
My father, Xiao Xilou,
was killed by the Power Gang.

13:02.580 --> 13:04.530
I believe you all already know this.

13:04.530 --> 13:05.930
It's truly unfortunate.

13:05.970 --> 13:07.150
Your father, Mr. Xiao,

13:07.150 --> 13:09.550
had always been a representative
of righteous sects in Jindu,

13:09.550 --> 13:11.440
protecting the martial world here
for many years.

13:11.440 --> 13:14.600
Now that the Huanhua Sect's
foundation has been completely destroyed,

13:14.600 --> 13:18.320
we, the martial artists of Jindu,
all feel deeply threatened as well.

13:18.320 --> 13:18.960
Indeed.

13:19.840 --> 13:21.580
Over 100 people from the Huanhua Sect
have died.

13:21.580 --> 13:22.640
It's truly tragic.

13:25.960 --> 13:26.600
Everyone.

13:27.080 --> 13:29.000
The reason I've invited you all here today

13:29.000 --> 13:31.000
is to discuss this matter together.

13:31.320 --> 13:31.960
Someone.

13:42.790 --> 13:44.790
[Huanhua Sect]

13:44.460 --> 13:45.860
Huanhua Sect?

13:45.960 --> 13:47.480
They're planning to rebuild the sect?

13:47.480 --> 13:48.480
Reestablishing the Huanhua Sect?

13:48.480 --> 13:49.120
This is great news.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.440
Reestablishing the Huanhua Sect.

13:50.440 --> 13:51.500
We must support it.

13:52.080 --> 13:54.140
He's trying to reestablish the sect?

13:55.000 --> 13:55.840
Indeed.

13:56.390 --> 13:56.840
Right.

14:03.240 --> 14:03.840
Good news.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.890
Reestablishing the Huanhua Sect?

14:07.120 --> 14:07.870
Everyone.

14:08.360 --> 14:10.720
I am a man of limited virtue and talent.
In terms of martial skills

14:10.720 --> 14:14.080
and status in the martial world,
I can't hold a candle to my father.

14:14.080 --> 14:15.940
But now that my father has passed,

14:16.150 --> 14:19.360
I, Xiao Yiren, wish to reestablish
our Huanhua Sect

14:19.910 --> 14:21.600
and lead the martial world of Jindu.

14:21.600 --> 14:24.240
Today I reopen our sect here,

14:24.590 --> 14:26.120
recruiting new disciples,

14:26.240 --> 14:28.670
and I hope you all
can lend me your support.

14:29.270 --> 14:32.430
Of course we'll support
the revitalization of the Xiao family.

14:32.430 --> 14:33.360
That's right.

14:33.840 --> 14:35.440
Huanhua regaining its glory

14:35.440 --> 14:37.300
benefits us all with no downside.

14:37.600 --> 14:38.440
Yes, indeed.

14:38.440 --> 14:40.270
Congratulations, Mr. Xiao.

14:40.270 --> 14:42.530
-Congratulations.
-Congratulations.

14:45.870 --> 14:47.200
Mr. Xiao, your ambition

14:47.510 --> 14:48.510
impresses us all.

14:49.030 --> 14:52.230
May I ask what plans you have
for reestablishing Huanhua?

14:53.910 --> 14:57.150
Years ago, our ancestors, to protect
the martial world of Jindu,

14:57.150 --> 14:59.670
leased the land between the Xiao family
and Tang Sect

14:59.670 --> 15:03.130
to various sects in Jindu for free
under a 100-year agreement.

15:03.480 --> 15:05.600
Now that Huanhua is being reestablished,

15:05.600 --> 15:06.240
I hope

15:06.360 --> 15:08.790
you all can return the land

15:09.270 --> 15:11.400
and pay the rent for the past 100 years.

15:11.630 --> 15:12.630
100 years of rent?

15:12.720 --> 15:13.320
So much?

15:14.150 --> 15:14.870
Mr. Xiao.

15:15.360 --> 15:16.750
But your father promised

15:16.750 --> 15:18.480
to lease the land to us for free.

15:18.630 --> 15:19.960
It was because my father

15:20.030 --> 15:23.030
valued the brotherhood among
Jindu's martial arts sects.

15:23.030 --> 15:25.430
But now that our Xiao family
is in distress,

15:25.600 --> 15:28.000
I hope you all
can show some understanding.

15:28.150 --> 15:29.840
But it was your father, Xiao Xilou,

15:29.840 --> 15:31.200
who leased the land to us.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.870
What right do you have to take it back?

15:32.870 --> 15:35.150
I am now the young leader
of the Xiao family.

15:35.150 --> 15:36.480
Are you questioning me?

15:36.510 --> 15:37.390
To be honest,

15:37.720 --> 15:40.200
our sect has signed a contract
with the Tang Sect yesterday.

15:40.200 --> 15:40.510
You...

15:40.510 --> 15:42.720
I've paid the annual rent of that land
to the Tang Sect.

15:42.720 --> 15:43.870
If you want money or grain,

15:43.870 --> 15:45.550
you can ask the Tang Sect for it.

15:45.550 --> 15:46.440
Tang Sect?

15:47.360 --> 15:48.750
Our Guidao Sect's land

15:48.750 --> 15:50.600
has also been promised to the Tang Sect.

15:50.600 --> 15:51.860
Have you all forgotten

15:52.390 --> 15:53.910
that what you owe the Xiao family now

15:53.910 --> 15:56.150
is far more than just a land deed?

15:56.400 --> 15:57.160
Xiao Yiren.

15:57.270 --> 15:58.480
By acting this way,

15:58.730 --> 16:02.130
aren't you afraid of ruining
the Huanhua Sect's reputation?

16:02.440 --> 16:05.600
My father Xiao Xilou was kind-hearted
all his life,

16:05.800 --> 16:08.030
which is why Huanhua
has its reputation today.

16:08.030 --> 16:09.960
But what has this reputation brought us?

16:09.960 --> 16:11.750
It has only brought people like you

16:11.750 --> 16:13.680
who have forgotten past kindness!

16:15.100 --> 16:15.870
Huh? What even is this?

16:15.870 --> 16:16.440
Enough.

16:16.960 --> 16:18.960
Let's end these hurtful words here.

16:19.320 --> 16:21.850
I believe you all understand
what's at stake.

16:22.150 --> 16:24.670
I'll give you all half a month's grace,

16:25.120 --> 16:28.270
with the deadline being 11:45 a.m.
on the first day of next month.

16:28.270 --> 16:31.200
I expect everyone to hand over
the deeds and money.

16:31.720 --> 16:33.360
I knew Mr. Xiao

16:33.360 --> 16:35.090
was setting a trap for us today.

16:35.790 --> 16:36.520
I'm leaving.

16:36.840 --> 16:37.700
We're leaving!

16:45.630 --> 16:46.840
Third Young Master of the Xiao family?

16:46.840 --> 16:47.510
It's him.

16:47.670 --> 16:49.550
The Xiao family's downfall
is all his fault!

16:49.550 --> 16:50.910
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

17:06.030 --> 17:08.310
Today is the day of
Huanhua Sect's reestablishment.

17:08.310 --> 17:09.640
What are you doing here?

17:14.720 --> 17:15.349
Yiren.

17:16.550 --> 17:18.280
Father and Mother once told us,

17:19.200 --> 17:22.200
a gentleman never uses kindness
to demand repayment.

17:22.310 --> 17:24.109
They are all despicable people.

17:24.310 --> 17:27.349
How can we be like them?

17:27.680 --> 17:29.160
Stop your shameless talk.

17:31.640 --> 17:32.900
These martial artists

17:33.200 --> 17:35.720
sought to protect their own interests
when our Xiao family is in distress.

17:35.720 --> 17:38.160
Their lack of loyalty and righteousness
came first.

17:38.160 --> 17:40.440
I'm merely repaying them in kind.

17:40.440 --> 17:41.750
What's wrong is there in that?

17:41.750 --> 17:44.000
If I don't use these methods
to revitalize the Xiao family,

17:44.000 --> 17:45.130
what else could I do?

17:47.400 --> 17:49.070
I don't mean to accuse you.

17:50.590 --> 17:53.720
But if you use such means
to manipulate people's hearts,

17:54.470 --> 17:55.810
isn't that the same as the Power Gang...

17:55.810 --> 17:56.570
Shut up!

17:57.640 --> 17:59.970
How dare you bring up
the Power Gang again!

18:00.200 --> 18:02.170
If it weren't for you
letting the wolf into our house back then,

18:02.170 --> 18:04.350
giving that villain Liu Suifeng
an opportunity,

18:04.350 --> 18:06.830
would our Xiao family have suffered
such a catastrophic disaster?

18:06.830 --> 18:07.510
Yiren.

18:14.400 --> 18:16.030
Do you know
why I didn't return to Sword Manor

18:16.030 --> 18:18.310
after the seventh day
following our parents' passing?

18:18.310 --> 18:21.400
It was because I was afraid that
if I saw you,

18:21.400 --> 18:24.200
I wouldn't be able to hold back
from punishing you!

18:24.830 --> 18:26.200
You've really let me down!

18:26.200 --> 18:27.600
Yiren, please calm down.

18:28.160 --> 18:29.880
Qiushui has lost all his martial skills.

18:29.880 --> 18:31.480
Why bother arguing with him?

18:31.510 --> 18:32.510
Does his behavior

18:32.920 --> 18:34.980
do justice to our Xiao family's name?

19:27.160 --> 19:27.750
Qiushui.

19:28.400 --> 19:29.070
Qiushui!

19:30.570 --> 19:33.040
[Liang Residence]

19:51.370 --> 19:52.700
Qiushui, you're awake.

19:55.440 --> 19:56.200
Mr. Liang.

19:56.350 --> 19:57.010
Don't move.

19:58.030 --> 19:59.890
You haven't fully recovered yet.

20:00.030 --> 20:00.750
Mr. Liang,

20:01.960 --> 20:02.920
where am I?

20:03.200 --> 20:06.330
The reconstruction of Huanhua Sect
will take some time.

20:06.400 --> 20:08.000
This is my private residence.

20:08.000 --> 20:10.880
It's big enough for you and your friends
to live in together.

20:10.880 --> 20:13.880
I'm troubling you again.

20:14.720 --> 20:15.480
Mr. Liang.

20:16.160 --> 20:18.020
Thank you for your help all along.

20:18.350 --> 20:20.440
I've heard about

20:20.960 --> 20:22.820
everything you've been through.

20:23.440 --> 20:24.680
You have extraordinary courage,

20:24.680 --> 20:27.310
forming the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood
to fight against the Power Gang.

20:27.310 --> 20:30.370
Actually, you're already famous
throughout the land.

20:35.640 --> 20:38.240
Unfortunately, I couldn't
protect anything.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.690
Nothing has changed at all.

20:42.920 --> 20:44.120
I originally thought

20:45.360 --> 20:48.960
that I alone could shake
the entire martial world.

20:51.070 --> 20:53.030
You've been unconscious for two days.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.360
You probably don't know

20:54.750 --> 20:56.280
what's happened out there.

20:57.160 --> 20:58.640
Come on, follow me.

21:06.400 --> 21:12.110
-Mr. Xiao!
-Mr. Xiao!

21:15.590 --> 21:17.400
Greetings, Mr. Xiao!

21:19.740 --> 21:21.200
The Du family of Fuhu Sect from Guangling

21:21.200 --> 21:23.860
has come to pay respects
to our savior, Mr. Xiao.

21:24.510 --> 21:26.030
The Five Tigers of the Xu family
from Guangling

21:26.030 --> 21:28.760
have come to pay respects
to our savior, Mr. Xiao.

21:29.400 --> 21:30.590
Baibu Sect from Guangling

21:30.590 --> 21:32.350
has come to pay respects to Mr. Xiao.

21:32.350 --> 21:33.790
Greetings, Mr. Xiao!

21:36.000 --> 21:36.530
Qiushui.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.030
Mr. Xiao.

21:42.510 --> 21:45.400
Thanks to your risking your life days ago
to expose Qu Hanshan

21:45.400 --> 21:47.330
as the Sword King of the Power Gang.

21:47.590 --> 21:49.720
More than 10 of our sects joined forces

21:50.030 --> 21:52.030
to drive back Qu Hanshan's minions.

21:52.240 --> 21:54.270
Unfortunately, we arrived too late

21:55.440 --> 21:56.880
to help the Xiao family.

22:03.070 --> 22:03.920
Are you saying

22:07.070 --> 22:09.070
I saved more than 10 of your sects?

22:09.750 --> 22:11.000
Yes, indeed.

22:11.000 --> 22:12.680
All the martial arts sects in Guangling

22:12.680 --> 22:14.280
have risen up in resistance.

22:14.550 --> 22:16.610
Qu Hanshan's influence in Guangling

22:17.240 --> 22:18.720
has greatly diminished, too.

22:18.720 --> 22:19.960
Right, indeed.

22:24.550 --> 22:25.240
Mr. Xiao!

22:28.590 --> 22:29.310
Mr. Xiao.

22:29.310 --> 22:30.310
I'm a personal guard of the Wu family.

22:30.310 --> 22:33.370
This is a handwritten letter
from Old Madam Wu herself.

22:33.920 --> 22:36.180
You work for General Wu at Immortal Pass?

22:36.370 --> 22:37.350
A letter from Old Madam Wu?

22:37.350 --> 22:39.240
A handwritten letter
from Old Madam Wu herself?

22:39.240 --> 22:40.300
What's happening?

22:40.310 --> 22:41.200
What does it say?

22:41.200 --> 22:41.790
Indeed.

22:43.480 --> 22:45.030
"Thanks to the kindness of Huanhua Sect,

22:45.030 --> 22:47.000
I, carrying the token of immunity
bestowed by the late emperor,

22:47.000 --> 22:48.720
have cleared my son's false charges.

22:48.720 --> 22:51.270
Afterward, he led his troops
straight to Immortal Pass, and on the 15th

22:51.270 --> 22:53.830
of this month, launched a night attack
on the Northern Wastelanders,

22:53.830 --> 22:55.510
reclaiming over 100 miles of territory.

22:55.510 --> 22:57.510
I hereby send this letter
to announce our victory.

22:57.510 --> 22:58.710
Written by Madam Wu."

22:59.030 --> 23:01.090
Victory news from the Immortal Pass.

23:01.200 --> 23:02.330
It's been two years,

23:04.230 --> 23:06.640
and the front finally sent
the first report of victory.

23:06.640 --> 23:07.640
Wonderful! It's victory news!

23:07.640 --> 23:09.350
Great! Victory news!

23:10.160 --> 23:12.350
Great! That's wonderful!

23:12.970 --> 23:13.690
Great!

23:14.640 --> 23:16.880
According to the plot I remember
from the book,

23:16.880 --> 23:18.110
Old Madam Wu should have died

23:18.110 --> 23:19.590
on her way to the Immortal Pass.

23:19.590 --> 23:22.680
On the 15th, the Northern Wastelanders
should have launched a night attack

23:22.680 --> 23:24.070
on the Immortal Pass. But now,
General Wu has led his troops

23:24.070 --> 23:24.880
to the Immortal Pass

23:24.880 --> 23:26.510
and defeated the Northern Wasteland Army
outside the pass.

23:26.510 --> 23:29.510
So this world has already been changed.

23:30.270 --> 23:31.510
I can also rewrite

23:31.510 --> 23:32.970
Xiao Qiushui's story now.

23:33.160 --> 23:33.880
Mr. Xiao.

23:34.240 --> 23:35.500
You saved so many of us.

23:35.790 --> 23:38.160
Today, we didn't come to
the Xiao Residence

23:38.160 --> 23:39.550
just to talk.

23:39.830 --> 23:41.690
Yes, disciples from all our sects

23:41.790 --> 23:44.000
have brought large quantities of
quality wood and stone materials,

23:44.000 --> 23:46.270
and they're now
at the foot of the mountain.

23:46.270 --> 23:47.240
Starting today,

23:47.480 --> 23:49.740
we'll help you rebuild the Huanhua Sect!

23:50.070 --> 23:53.270
We hope you can rally
and recover your strength, Mr. Xiao.

23:53.370 --> 23:54.700
Yes, rally and recover!

23:59.590 --> 24:00.350
Mr. Xiao.

24:00.510 --> 24:01.510
If you don't mind,

24:01.640 --> 24:04.680
please accept us all as disciples under
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood

24:04.680 --> 24:06.270
and let us establish
a branch for you in Guangling.

24:06.270 --> 24:07.480
What do you say?

24:07.750 --> 24:09.240
That's right!

24:10.400 --> 24:11.930
Right, establish a branch!

24:14.030 --> 24:14.590
Right.

24:15.200 --> 24:16.070
Let's build a branch!

24:16.070 --> 24:16.790
Count me in!

24:16.790 --> 24:17.750
We'll all go together!

24:17.750 --> 24:19.230
Right, let's join
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

24:19.230 --> 24:19.920
Everyone,

24:22.590 --> 24:24.650
thank you for your support and trust.

24:26.000 --> 24:26.920
But right now,

24:28.940 --> 24:31.070
I cannot take on this responsibility.

24:31.070 --> 24:32.510
We only acknowledge Mr. Xiao!

24:32.510 --> 24:33.440
Right.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.400
We only acknowledge Mr. Xiao!

24:34.400 --> 24:35.680
Please stop declining, Mr. Xiao.

24:35.680 --> 24:36.680
That's right.

24:36.680 --> 24:38.080
We only acknowledge you.

24:42.000 --> 24:42.560
Qiushui,

24:42.920 --> 24:45.590
I don't think you should decline
any further.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.640
Right, Mr. Xiao, please stop declining.

24:47.640 --> 24:48.720
Say yes, please.

24:48.720 --> 24:49.480
Say yes.

24:49.590 --> 24:51.310
Stop declining.
We'll all follow your lead.

24:51.310 --> 24:52.510
Come on, get on board.

24:56.710 --> 24:57.400
Everyone,

24:59.950 --> 25:02.880
I, Xiao Qiushui,
cannot take the position of leader.

25:03.070 --> 25:04.270
But I welcome you all

25:06.270 --> 25:08.270
to join the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

25:08.270 --> 25:10.030
Great! Mr. Xiao has finally agreed!

25:10.030 --> 25:10.750
Wonderful!

25:15.710 --> 25:16.310
Everyone,

25:17.240 --> 25:19.270
let's start rebuilding the Xiao Residence!

25:19.270 --> 25:22.030
Let's get to work!

25:22.030 --> 25:22.960
Great! Let's go.

25:29.160 --> 25:30.290
By the way, Qiushui.

25:30.480 --> 25:33.140
Your sister has been reading
some ancient books

25:33.190 --> 25:35.590
and found a way
to reconnect the meridians.

25:36.020 --> 25:36.750
You go ahead.

25:37.030 --> 25:38.630
Leave the matters here to me.

26:02.790 --> 26:03.920
Miss Tang.

26:04.070 --> 26:05.720
According to what you've said,

26:05.720 --> 26:06.920
the person you want to save

26:06.920 --> 26:08.790
not only has completely severed meridians,

26:08.790 --> 26:09.830
but also has

26:09.920 --> 26:12.880
a powerful conflicting internal energy
inside his body.

26:12.880 --> 26:17.750
In my 50 years of medical practice,

26:18.070 --> 26:20.270
I've never heard of such kind of injury.

26:22.590 --> 26:25.440
The fact that he's still alive

26:27.920 --> 26:31.070
is already heaven's blessing.

26:31.200 --> 26:31.880
Mr. Liu,

26:32.350 --> 26:34.400
even you can't save him?

26:38.310 --> 26:41.310
This prescription can help
clear his energy channels

26:41.640 --> 26:43.110
and extend his life for a few years.

26:43.110 --> 26:45.110
But if you want him to fully recover,

26:45.400 --> 26:48.680
I truly have no way to help.

26:51.110 --> 26:52.510
So in this martial world,

26:52.550 --> 26:54.550
there's no one else who can heal him?

26:55.240 --> 26:56.480
Forgive my prying,

26:57.750 --> 26:59.480
but this person you want to save

27:00.150 --> 27:01.630
is your beloved, isn't he?

27:08.350 --> 27:10.790
Mr. Liu, why would you ask
such a question?

27:12.240 --> 27:15.720
Your father Tang Yaoshun,
as head of the Tang Sect,

27:16.590 --> 27:18.270
is not only skilled in medicine

27:18.270 --> 27:21.000
but also masters
the bone-dislocation technique.

27:21.000 --> 27:23.000
When it comes to reconnecting meridians,

27:23.000 --> 27:26.240
asking him would be far better
than asking me.

27:28.920 --> 27:31.110
If you weren't deliberately
hiding this from him,

27:31.110 --> 27:32.960
why would you have come to me?

27:34.400 --> 27:36.490
You must decide
whether to save this young hero

27:36.490 --> 27:38.420
or keep hiding it from your father.

27:39.750 --> 27:40.960
The choice is yours.

27:43.880 --> 27:44.940
Thank you, Mr. Liu.

28:02.590 --> 28:03.270
Qiushui.

28:07.240 --> 28:07.920
Qiushui?

28:09.310 --> 28:10.040
Big Brother.

28:10.590 --> 28:12.120
Big Brother, you're awake.

28:14.550 --> 28:17.110
Xueyu, how long have I been asleep?

28:17.540 --> 28:18.870
Two days and two nights.

28:30.750 --> 28:34.310
Only 40% of your meridians have been
reconnected. You need to rest well.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.480
Thank you, Xueyu.

28:36.160 --> 28:36.960
Come on, guys.

28:37.980 --> 28:39.370
Let's go practice our swordsmanship.

28:39.370 --> 28:40.070
Big Brother!

28:40.070 --> 28:41.960
Xueyu said your recovery only allows you
to handle your daily activities.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.310
She never said you could
start practicing martial arts.

28:43.310 --> 28:45.160
Your wrist still feels like
it's being cut with a blade.

28:45.160 --> 28:46.620
Why rush yourself so much?

28:46.640 --> 28:48.000
I've lost all my martial skills,

28:48.000 --> 28:49.470
so I have to start from scratch.

28:49.470 --> 28:50.550
I'm out of time.

29:01.680 --> 29:02.270
Again!

29:02.450 --> 29:04.050
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

29:04.110 --> 29:05.240
Please take a break.

29:05.270 --> 29:07.370
If you keep going like this,
your body will collapse.

29:07.370 --> 29:07.930
I'm fine.

29:08.310 --> 29:09.040
Big Brother!

29:09.270 --> 29:10.310
Xueyu also said

29:10.640 --> 29:12.480
that reconnecting meridians
is like cutting into bone and marrow.

29:12.480 --> 29:14.110
There's no need to rush your revenge.

29:14.110 --> 29:16.110
You should rest and make long-term plans.

29:16.110 --> 29:17.640
With the time you spent advising me,

29:17.640 --> 29:19.030
we could have practiced a few more moves.

29:19.030 --> 29:19.720
Again!

30:23.680 --> 30:25.010
Excellent sword skill.

30:27.720 --> 30:29.550
I didn't expect that in just a few days,

30:29.550 --> 30:31.210
you'd recover to this extent.

30:32.510 --> 30:33.840
Thanks a lot, Mr. Liang.

30:34.110 --> 30:35.770
I can never repay the kindness

30:36.400 --> 30:38.200
you've shown me recently, Mr. Liang.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.400
No need for such formalities.

30:39.400 --> 30:41.240
It's my honor to support young talents

30:41.240 --> 30:42.440
in the martial world.

30:43.150 --> 30:43.980
By the way, Qiushui.

30:43.980 --> 30:45.710
That day at Xiao's Sword Manor,

30:45.750 --> 30:46.920
I found something,

30:47.440 --> 30:49.300
but I didn't dare to give it to you.

30:49.390 --> 30:52.020
Now, I can finally hand it over to you.

30:56.620 --> 30:59.100
[To my son.]
[From Xiao Xilou]

31:03.680 --> 31:09.550
To my sons: Yiren, Kaiyan, and Qiushui.

31:11.310 --> 31:14.200
The siege on Sword Manor
is now impossible to break.

31:15.130 --> 31:19.410
If I never see you again, it'll mean that

31:20.200 --> 31:25.160
in this battle, the Xiao family has died
protecting loyalty and righteousness.

31:26.240 --> 31:28.400
I have no regrets.

31:29.680 --> 31:32.720
I'm writing this letter
to make my wishes clear.

31:33.830 --> 31:38.830
Over 100 years ago, our Xiao family
was also nearly destroyed.

31:39.610 --> 31:43.400
But our ancestors, through broken swords,
expressed their resolve.

31:43.400 --> 31:47.440
They forged 128 broken swords into
the Changge Sword,

31:48.030 --> 31:52.350
gathering the loyal and righteous souls
of the Xiao family into one sword.

31:53.960 --> 31:56.000
Those of you who see this letter

31:56.790 --> 31:59.200
must be the ones to carry on our will.

32:00.400 --> 32:02.660
The Changge Sword
has a spirit of its own.

32:03.070 --> 32:07.270
In times of danger,
it will find its master through fate.

32:08.350 --> 32:09.640
Remember, my sons.

32:10.270 --> 32:12.110
The sword is broken and reforged.

32:12.110 --> 32:13.640
The flower blooms itself.

32:14.550 --> 32:16.920
Even if the body is destroyed
and the bones crippled,

32:16.920 --> 32:18.240
it's just a new start.

32:19.750 --> 32:21.830
If you can retrieve the Changge Sword,

32:21.830 --> 32:25.350
the legacy of Huanhua Sect will never die.

32:28.720 --> 32:29.880
Xiao Xilou.

32:30.680 --> 32:34.310
At Sword Manor on June 2.

32:57.960 --> 32:59.110
June 2.

33:00.480 --> 33:02.810
That was 15 days
after we left Sword Manor.

33:07.940 --> 33:10.050
Could Father have already...

33:12.400 --> 33:14.730
Actually, your father had known all along

33:16.120 --> 33:18.680
that staying at Sword Manor
meant certain death.

33:18.680 --> 33:21.830
That's why he sent you to escape
and seek help.

33:22.900 --> 33:23.750
In truth,

33:25.420 --> 33:27.280
he was giving the hope of survival

33:29.210 --> 33:30.250
to you.

33:32.310 --> 33:33.720
It was all my fault.

33:34.680 --> 33:36.280
I came back too late.

33:37.750 --> 33:39.360
It was all my fault.

33:44.680 --> 33:45.440
Qiushui.

33:46.110 --> 33:48.370
Your father clearly stated
in his letter

33:49.030 --> 33:51.510
that you should not blame yourself
or grieve.

33:51.510 --> 33:52.640
These past few days,

33:53.310 --> 33:54.960
I've seen your spirit faltering.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.890
I worried you might never recover.

33:57.510 --> 33:59.920
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

33:58.510 --> 33:59.510
But now,

34:00.110 --> 34:01.920
I hope you can honor your father's wishes,

34:00.780 --> 34:03.560
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

34:03.350 --> 34:04.960
pull yourself together soon,

34:04.960 --> 34:06.920
retrieve the Changge Sword,
and restore the Xiao family.

34:05.170 --> 34:08.340
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

34:08.679 --> 34:13.080
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

34:13.929 --> 34:17.330
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

34:17.719 --> 34:21.080
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

34:22.020 --> 34:24.840
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

34:24.860 --> 34:29.560
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

34:29.610 --> 34:31.610
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

34:30.030 --> 34:30.880
My dad said

34:31.630 --> 34:33.630
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

34:32.550 --> 34:34.190
that the Changge Sword has its own spirit.

34:33.850 --> 34:36.590
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

34:34.920 --> 34:37.050
In times of danger for the Xiao family,

34:37.170 --> 34:39.400
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

34:38.960 --> 34:40.590
it will find its master through fate.

34:39.420 --> 34:44.770
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

34:43.150 --> 34:45.150
But now, I'm just a useless man.

34:45.620 --> 34:47.679
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

34:47.699 --> 34:49.699
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

34:47.719 --> 34:49.719
I fear I'll fail my father's wishes.

34:49.840 --> 34:51.280
That's not true, Qiushui.

34:49.840 --> 34:52.980
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

34:52.000 --> 34:52.710
Look here.

34:52.949 --> 34:54.500
You buried these people
with your own hands.

34:53.230 --> 34:55.530
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

34:54.929 --> 34:57.210
You built the sword graves
and carved the tombstones yourself.

34:55.630 --> 34:59.730
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

35:03.400 --> 35:04.170
Mr. Liang.

35:06.840 --> 35:09.440
This is what every member
of the Xiao family...

35:10.360 --> 35:13.360
This is what every member
of the Xiao family should do.

35:19.000 --> 35:19.670
Qiushui.

35:20.590 --> 35:22.760
You were able to treat everyone equally
and bury all those of the Xiao household

35:22.760 --> 35:25.420
with your own hands
regardless of their status.

35:25.840 --> 35:28.570
This shows you have righteousness
in your heart.

35:28.760 --> 35:30.150
The Xiao family has stood firm
in Jindu's martial world

35:30.150 --> 35:31.360
for 100 years

35:32.360 --> 35:34.420
because of this very righteousness.

35:35.110 --> 35:36.910
And this is also the exact reason

35:37.030 --> 35:40.320
why those martial artists admire
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood so much.

35:37.430 --> 35:39.420
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

35:40.440 --> 35:43.430
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

35:41.030 --> 35:43.230
Now, the Xiao family
may lack humanpower and weapons,

35:43.230 --> 35:44.920
but these can be bought with money.

35:44.920 --> 35:46.670
However, a kind-hearted
and righteous leader

35:44.930 --> 35:48.440
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

35:47.670 --> 35:49.670
cannot be bought
with any amount of wealth.

35:48.630 --> 35:53.260
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

35:50.880 --> 35:51.410
Qiushui.

35:52.480 --> 35:54.480
The word "chivalry"
never lies in the sword,

35:53.610 --> 35:55.940
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

35:55.440 --> 35:56.770
but in people's hearts.

35:57.420 --> 36:00.600
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

35:59.400 --> 36:00.230
I believe

36:00.960 --> 36:02.360
this fate will surely find you.

36:01.480 --> 36:04.500
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

36:03.320 --> 36:04.280
I believe in you.

36:04.520 --> 36:09.580
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

36:09.600 --> 36:11.470
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

36:10.070 --> 36:10.840
Mr. Liang.

36:11.600 --> 36:13.600
♪ A few wild howls ♪

36:13.770 --> 36:16.830
♪ Come and go like flying birds ♪

36:14.360 --> 36:16.160
Thank you for your honest words.

36:17.250 --> 36:19.340
♪ Having witnessed countless miles
of sorrow and joy ♪

36:17.280 --> 36:18.230
I understand

36:19.360 --> 36:24.460
♪  I've naturally gained courage
to be a hero ♪

36:19.590 --> 36:20.710
what you said.

36:25.660 --> 36:27.570
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

36:27.590 --> 36:29.730
♪ Several rounds of turmoil ♪

36:29.750 --> 36:32.720
♪ Swaying in life-and-death dreams ♪

36:33.360 --> 36:35.360
♪ Shadows under countless lamps
over a thousand lifetimes ♪

36:35.380 --> 36:40.220
♪ Each leaves a single light
to shine through this night ♪

38:09.990 --> 38:13.740
[Calm and Composed]

38:35.670 --> 38:37.330
Ancestors of the Xiao family.

38:37.590 --> 38:40.000
When our family faced calamity
100 years ago,

38:40.000 --> 38:41.960
you forged 128 broken swords

38:42.710 --> 38:44.040
into the Changge Sword,

38:44.230 --> 38:47.150
gathering the loyal souls
of our family into one blade.

38:47.150 --> 38:48.150
This time,

38:48.510 --> 38:51.400
including myself,
there're 128 people again.

38:52.190 --> 38:54.450
Now, only the sword in my hand is missing.

39:04.150 --> 39:06.610
Heroic seniors, I pay respect
to your souls.

39:07.110 --> 39:09.110
I, Xiao Qiushui of the Huanhua Sect,

39:10.070 --> 39:12.000
wish to retrieve the Changge Sword

39:12.480 --> 39:14.080
and revive the Huanhua Sect.

39:29.070 --> 39:34.230
♪ Wishing to borrow
the body of a firefly ♪

39:34.740 --> 39:39.040
♪ To see the world,
to see all living beings ♪

39:39.920 --> 39:45.880
♪ Then borrow the wind and snow,
the bone-deep cold ♪

39:46.650 --> 39:51.380
♪ To bring a spring
free of chill next year ♪

39:52.560 --> 39:54.960
♪ If the long night is hard to pierce ♪

39:54.980 --> 39:57.840
♪ Then tear open the darkness ♪

39:57.890 --> 40:03.210
♪ Hold a tiny flame, light a lone lamp ♪

40:03.840 --> 40:07.570
♪ Let my body be the chess piece,
entering this labyrinth ♪

40:07.980 --> 40:09.890
♪ Journey into the cage once more ♪

40:10.040 --> 40:11.840
♪ Hoping that
amid the dark wind and rain ♪

40:11.870 --> 40:15.720
♪ I can glimpse a sliver of sky ♪

40:15.750 --> 40:18.530
♪ Though the path be all frost and storm ♪

40:18.550 --> 40:21.650
♪ Though life may have no companion ♪

40:22.000 --> 40:27.840
♪ I have no regrets,
and the heart moves onward ♪

40:30.440 --> 40:33.040
Congratulations on becoming
the Master of Huanhua Sect.

40:33.040 --> 40:34.760
You've completed your missions.

40:34.760 --> 40:36.920
You may unlock the following reward,

40:39.150 --> 40:40.950
the character selection right,

40:41.000 --> 40:42.190
to become another character

40:42.190 --> 40:44.000
and continue the main quest.

40:44.270 --> 40:47.510
[Character Selection Right]
[Exit the System and Return to Reality]

40:44.400 --> 40:46.230
Or you can choose to exit the game

40:47.300 --> 40:48.900
and return to the real world.

40:50.110 --> 40:51.800
You want me to quit now?

40:52.960 --> 40:55.620
But I still have so many things left
unfinished.

40:56.510 --> 40:59.000
The Huanhua Sect, the Xiao family...

41:01.590 --> 41:02.850
I won't choose either.

41:06.110 --> 41:07.280
System warning!

41:07.280 --> 41:09.280
Please make your choice carefully.

41:09.480 --> 41:11.030
If violations occur,

41:11.190 --> 41:13.000
the system will force exit

41:13.030 --> 41:14.440
and erase all data.

41:14.840 --> 41:16.320
As Xiao Mingming,

41:16.480 --> 41:19.440
your real-world memories
will gradually disappear.

41:19.440 --> 41:21.760
Your body will be forcibly occupied
by the system,

41:21.760 --> 41:25.290
and you'll be trapped
in the Magic Codex forever with no escape.

41:36.480 --> 41:38.080
I must avenge those who died.

41:38.930 --> 41:40.840
They were all real people!

41:42.920 --> 41:43.940
Destroying the system means

41:43.940 --> 41:45.600
you'll never be able to leave!

41:45.960 --> 41:47.190
Whether I'm Xiao Mingming

41:47.190 --> 41:48.710
or Xiao Qiushui,

41:49.070 --> 41:51.070
I'll only make the right choice!

42:09.840 --> 42:11.700
The sword is broken and reforged.

42:12.630 --> 42:14.090
The flower blooms itself.

42:16.190 --> 42:19.120
Even if the body is destroyed
and the bones crippled,

42:20.520 --> 42:21.730
it's just a new start.

42:23.550 --> 42:25.280
The sword is broken and reforged.

42:25.280 --> 42:26.740
The flower blooms itself.

42:27.480 --> 42:29.400
Son, remember:

42:30.510 --> 42:32.510
even if you're shattered to pieces,

42:33.110 --> 42:35.510
it's merely a chance to start anew.
